WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.601 --> 00:00:02.482
- Oh (beep).

00:00:02.482 --> 00:00:03.321
(laughter)

00:00:03.321 --> 00:00:04.154
Oh (beep).

00:00:04.154 --> 00:00:06.792
(laughter)

00:00:06.792 --> 00:00:09.459
(western music)

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.833
(whip crack)

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:18.666
Wait I need a second.

00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:22.833
(laughter) Oh my God
I don't wanna do this.

00:00:25.935 --> 00:00:27.525
- I mean it looks totally doable.

00:00:27.525 --> 00:00:30.345
- Looks and smells delicious,
looks like a Dorito.

00:00:30.345 --> 00:00:32.421
- [Cameraman] Three, two, one.

00:00:32.421 --> 00:00:33.803
- Yolo.

00:00:33.803 --> 00:00:36.136
(crunching)

00:00:38.968 --> 00:00:42.292
It's spicy, it tastes just like a Dorito.

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:45.321
- Honestly it's spicy,
but it's not that bad.

00:00:45.321 --> 00:00:47.767
- Not the hottest thing that
I've ever had I don't think.

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:49.504
- I think I'm tearing up.

00:00:49.504 --> 00:00:51.921
- I am tearing up, oh my God.

00:00:53.674 --> 00:00:55.657
- OK wait. (coughs)

00:00:55.657 --> 00:00:56.490
- My God.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:58.835
- My tongue is numb. (coughs)

00:00:58.835 --> 00:00:59.982
I'm good are you OK?

00:00:59.982 --> 00:01:01.981
- I'm OK, it's starting to hurt now.

00:01:01.981 --> 00:01:04.279
- Oh man, I don't, my ears.

00:01:04.279 --> 00:01:07.391
- There's like a pain
cemented in all of my mouth.

00:01:07.391 --> 00:01:10.555
- OK never mind, taking
that back. (coughs)

00:01:10.555 --> 00:01:11.990
- I am tearing up literally right now.

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:13.293
- [Cameraman] Don't touch your eye.

00:01:13.293 --> 00:01:14.788
- That is right, I touched my eye

00:01:14.788 --> 00:01:16.225
when I was not supposed to.

00:01:16.225 --> 00:01:18.173
- I'm not feeling really all that great.

00:01:18.173 --> 00:01:19.072
- [Cameraman] Where's the pain?

00:01:19.072 --> 00:01:19.905
- Everywhere.

00:01:19.905 --> 00:01:21.629
- Oh my God.
- You're crying.

00:01:21.629 --> 00:01:23.580
- I have no idea why I signed up for this.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:28.309
(coughing)
- It's an indescribable pain.

00:01:28.309 --> 00:01:32.194
Like there's gasoline on fire in my mouth.

00:01:32.194 --> 00:01:35.416
- It feels like someone's
stabbing me inside of my mouth.

00:01:35.416 --> 00:01:38.961
It's like getting a bunch
of paper cuts on your gums.

00:01:38.961 --> 00:01:40.794
Why would anyone even?

00:01:41.904 --> 00:01:43.502
- Yeah maybe it is bad.

00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:46.669
- I can't feel my lips right now, but.

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:51.674
(laughter)

00:01:51.674 --> 00:01:54.442
- Well you start questioning everything.

00:01:54.442 --> 00:01:56.082
- It hurts so much that my tongue

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:58.208
doesn't work the way it's supposed to.

00:01:58.208 --> 00:01:59.839
- [Cameraman] So scale of one to 10,

00:01:59.839 --> 00:02:00.879
how would you rank this?

00:02:00.879 --> 00:02:01.927
- Thousand.

00:02:01.927 --> 00:02:04.754
- This is definitely the
spiciest thing I've ever had.

00:02:04.754 --> 00:02:07.686
But it's not an enjoyable
spicy thing I would ever want.

00:02:07.686 --> 00:02:08.938
It's coming back.

00:02:08.938 --> 00:02:11.036
- That's the cruelest thing about it.

00:02:11.036 --> 00:02:14.348
You think it's over and then it just.

00:02:14.348 --> 00:02:16.291
Oh no, want the garbage can?

00:02:16.291 --> 00:02:18.124
- I'm not glad at all.

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:20.233
- I hate my life.

00:02:20.233 --> 00:02:22.287
(coughing)
- We signed up for this.

00:02:22.287 --> 00:02:23.120
- We did.

00:02:24.528 --> 00:02:25.531
- We just see an email and go,

00:02:25.531 --> 00:02:26.875
"Yeah that sounds like a good idea".

00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:29.875
- Yeah. (laughter)

